Look at navigationController.js: In update function, they do:

config.inputField.setAttribute("aria-activedescendant", list[currentFocus].dataset.value);

They should set to list[currentFocus].id (or maybe the element's id). The Item.js sets id: `${config.resultItem.className}_${index}`. The className is "autoCompleteJS_result". So id would be "autoCompleteJS_result_0", etc. That's what the test expects.

Thus fix: change navigationController.js line to set aria-activedescendant to list[currentFocus].id.

