Root cause: The navigation controller incorrectly sets aria-activedescendant to the item's data-value (the label) instead of the element's id, causing assistive technologies to announce the wrong active option.

Repair strategy: Change the assignment to use the list item's id attribute, which matches the expected autoCompleteJS_result_* identifiers used by the test suite.

