Expected accessibility effect: Arrow key navigation will correctly update aria-activedescendant to reference the active option element, allowing screen readers to announce the highlighted suggestion.

Functional risks: Potential side effects if any other code relies on dataset.value being set as aria-activedescendant; but only this controller sets it, and the item's id is stable. Should not break mouse selection because onSelection uses feedback from click event, not aria-activedescendant.

